{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10043","headline":"伊水门 · 楼頴","name":"伊水门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝涉伊水门，伊水入门流。\n惬心乃成兴，澹然泛孤舟。\n霏微傍青霭，容与随白鸥。\n竹阴交前浦，柳花媚中洲。\n日落阴云生，弥觉兹路幽。\n聊以恣所适，此外知何求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"楼頴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}